# Semgrep ignore list for this repository.
#
# IMPORTANT: when a repo-level .semgrepignore exists, Semgrep stops applying
# its built-in default ignore patterns, so those defaults are replicated
# below. Keep them in place when editing this file.

# Semgrep built-in defaults (replicated; do not remove)
.git/
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
.npm/
.yarn/
*.min.js
test/
tests/
*_test.go

# Repository-specific scope decisions
#
# .planning/ holds GSD planning artifacts: one-off diagnostic and migration
# scripts that were already executed by operators, plus plan documents. They
# are internal tooling, never deployed or imported by production code, so
# they are excluded from SAST scanning.
.planning/
